// ## Constructors (each returns a fresh object holding one reference)
//
// `rd_kafka_q_new0` (`rdkafka_queue.c:115-129`): `rkq = rd_malloc(…)`
// (non-null), `rd_kafka_q_init(rkq, rk)` or `rd_kafka_consume_q_init(rkq, rk)`
